msgctxt "378\t440"
msgid "Hold your horses there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504\t587"
msgid "You know this isn't a normal hotel, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "589\t648"
msgid "It's couples only in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "649\t680"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "681\t737"
msgid "What is she talking about?"
msgstr "Di cosa stava parlando?"

msgctxt "741\t853"
msgid "You two aren't the most\\nreputable looking characters, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "854\t998"
msgid "Can't have some thugs up and\\ncommitting crimes in one of my rooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012\t1131"
msgid "I, uh... guess people only\\ncome here for one thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352\t1403"
msgid "'Scuse me, ma'am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1422\t1483"
msgid "We've gotta be a couple to come in, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484\t1531"
msgid "No couple, no room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532\t1686"
msgid "Well, ain't a duo in town cuter\\nthan me and my aniki here! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1687\t1724"
msgid "Hold on...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1725\t1886"
msgid ""
"We usually keep it under wraps,\\nbut I just can't keep my hands off of him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1887\t2044"
msgid "Ohhh! I had no idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2048\t2133"
msgid "In that case, just a sec."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2178\t2340"
msgid "401's the only room open.\\nIt's a tight squeeze, but no worry there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2341\t2379"
msgid "Appreciate it! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2380\t2447"
msgid "The elevator's just in the back there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2468\t2535"
msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2666\t2726"
msgid "Kanda's on the fourth floor, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2744\t2775"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "2776\t2886"
msgid "Kinda run-down place for\\nthe patriarch of a major family, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2887\t3045"
msgid "I dunno. Maybe he's just not\\ntoo keen on spending his own money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3251\t3345"
msgid "Can you quit it with that already?"
msgstr ""
